</p><p class=3D""><strong>Shift-Left Controls</strong> =E2=80=93 Stop vulne=
rabilities before they reach production:</p><ul><li><p class=3D"my-0!">Revi=
ew API specifications for security requirements before deployment.</p></li>=
<li><p class=3D"my-0!">Enforce least-privilege permissions for each endpoin=
t.</p></li><li><p class=3D"my-0!">Apply strict input validation and schema =
enforcement in development.</p></li><li><p class=3D"my-0!">Integrate policy=
 checks directly into CI/CD pipelines.</p></li></ul><p class=3D""><strong>R=
untime &amp; Detection Controls</strong> =E2=80=93 Catch and contain threat=
s in production:</p><ul><li><p class=3D"my-0!">Inspect every API call for a=
bnormal methods, payload sizes, or schema drift.</p></li><li><p class=3D"my=
-0!">Verify token signatures, expiry, and audience on every hop, rejecting =
missing or tampered headers.</p></li><li><p class=3D"my-0!">Flag and redact=
