<li><p class=3D"my-0!">Monitor DNS, IP ranges, and ingress rules to identif=
y new or forgotten endpoints exposed to the internet.</p></li><li><p class=
=3D"my-0!">Alert on suspicious traffic patterns such as enumeration bursts,=
 spikes in error codes, or requests from unusual geographies.</p></li></ul>=
